<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70;">  exp</span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">:</span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> number</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">; </span><span style="--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;">// Unix timestamp; issuer SHOULD ≤120s for clients (MUST NOT exceed 300s); daemon tokens SHOULD use TTL ≥1h</span></span>
